omatree-egui (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * First Rust and egui prerelease for Linux x86_64. It installs next to the
    Qt package "omatree" and installs no file that package installs. Notebooks
    that hold an image (schema 4) or a colour tag (schema 5) cannot be opened
    by OmaTree 0.1.2.

